{"schemaVersion":1,"shard":74,"count":31,"items":[{"key":"[\"B1L02-2-10\",\"晚上\",\"晚上\",\"晚上\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"謝謝！明天晚上六點來我家，好不好？","pinyin":"Xièxie! Míngtiān wǎnshang liù diǎn lái wǒ jiā, hǎo bù hǎo?","english":"Thanks! How about coming to my place at 6 p.m. tomorrow?","sourceCardId":"B1L02-2-01","sourceFront":"明天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":2},{"chinese":"我今天晚上要去同學家玩。","pinyin":"Wǒ jīntiān wǎnshang yào qù tóngxué jiā wán.","english":"I am going to hang out with my classmate at his/her place tonight.","sourceCardId":"B1L03-3-02","sourceFront":"玩","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5},{"chinese":"下個星期華語課有期中考，我有一點兒緊張，所以每天晚上都讀書，也練習寫字，希望下個星期的考試能考得很好。","pinyin":"Xià ge xīngqí Huáyǔ kè yǒu qízhōngkǎo, wǒ yǒu yìdiǎnr jǐnzhāng, suǒyǐ měi tiān wǎnshang dōu dúshū, yě liànxí xiězì, xīwàng xià ge xīngqí de kǎoshì néng kǎo de hěn hǎo.","english":"I will have the midterm exam for Chinese class next week. I am a bit nervous so I study every night and practice writing Chinese characters as well. I hope I can do well on the exam next week.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"晚(evening) + 上(above) → the evening sky above: 晚上(evening; night)."},{"key":"[\"B1L07-1-15\",\"上车\",\"上車\",\"上车\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"你不要常常在家上網、看電腦、玩手機，應該去運動。明天我有空，我們可以一起去騎腳踏車。","pinyin":"Nǐ búyào chángcháng zài jiā shàngwǎng, kàn diànnǎo, wán shǒujī, yīnggāi qù yùndòng. Míngtiān wǒ yǒukòng, wǒmen kěyǐ yìqǐ qù qí jiǎotàchē.","english":"Don’t surf the internet, use the computer or play on the cell phone at home often. You should go exercise. I am available tomorrow. We can go ride bikes together.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-01","sourceFront":"電影","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L07-3-09\",\"飞机\",\"飛機\",\"飞机\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"機場附近的風景也很漂亮，我常常去看風景、看飛機。","pinyin":"Jīchǎng fùjìn de fēngjǐng yě hěn piàoliang, wǒ chángcháng qù kàn fēngjǐng, kàn fēijī.","english":"The scenery near the airport is beautiful; I often go there to see the view and watch the planes.","sourceCardId":"B1L07-3-01","sourceFront":"線","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":2}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L13-3-11\",\"坏\",\"壞\",\"坏\",\"Vp\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"他不是壞人，你不要怕他。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B1L13-3-11","sourceFront":"壞","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":1},{"chinese":"吃太多餅乾、薯條，只有壞處沒有好處。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-01","sourceFront":"好處","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"吃太多餅乾、薯條，只有壞處沒有好處。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L10-2-02","sourceFront":"壞處","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哥哥的性格開朗、樂觀，遇到麻煩也不會往壞處想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-09","sourceFront":"開朗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小歐為了省錢，整個月都吃泡麵，最後吃壞了身體，吃藥、住院花了更多錢。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L02-1-12","sourceFront":"泡麵","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"室友老是把髒襪子扔在地上，希望他能把這個壞習慣改掉。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-1-25","sourceFront":"扔","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我家的狗很乖，從不破壞家裡的東西","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-20","sourceFront":"破壞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"颱風快來了，破壞了我本來要去露營的計畫。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-20","sourceFront":"破壞","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個地區被颱風破壞得相當嚴重，不是樹木倒了，就是屋頂被吹走了，情況非常糟糕。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-24","sourceFront":"糟糕","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現在突然下起了大雨，我們的計畫被破壞了，恐怕今天所有的活動都必須重新安排。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L06-2-18","sourceFront":"重新","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我承認你的照相機是被我弄壞的，我一定負責把它修理好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L08-2-13","sourceFront":"承認","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"小游經常喝了酒還開車回家，太太警告他如果不改掉這個壞習慣，就要跟他離婚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-20","sourceFront":"警告","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你忙不過來的時候就該找人幫忙，別讓自己累壞了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-2-09","sourceFront":"該","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那個壞人殺了人，他知道自己錯了，到教堂去請求上帝原諒。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-1-22","sourceFront":"請求","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"因為冰箱壞了，裡面的食物除了雞蛋、蘋果，其他的都腐敗了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-1-25","sourceFront":"腐敗","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在我們學校，上課時是不能使用手機的，連老師也不能破壞規定。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-24","sourceFront":"規定","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"冰店的生意好壞得看季節，冬天的生意總是不如夏天。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-1-42","sourceFront":"不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類過度的發展活動，已對動植物的生活環境造成嚴重破壞。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-23","sourceFront":"過度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"博物館內的藝術品價值都很高，不小心弄壞了可是要賠償不少錢的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-09","sourceFront":"賠償","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"茶樹的葉子沒有被破壞的話，做出來的茶葉品質都比較好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-18","sourceFront":"葉子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他把我的手機壓壞了，我要他買一支賠我。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-16","sourceFront":"壓","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"人類破壞了自然，就是破壞了自己的生活環境。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-1-30","sourceFront":"自然","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"颱風過後，很多電線被強風吹壞了，需要幾天才能恢復正常。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-10","sourceFront":"電線","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"本地社區的房子常被好奇的觀光客破壞，令人們十分不滿。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-09","sourceFront":"好奇","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這部電腦的鍵盤有幾個鍵壞了，我得找人修理它。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-38","sourceFront":"鍵盤","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了發展工業而不斷開發，這樣下去森林早晚會被破壞光的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-2-10","sourceFront":"早晚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家博物館曾因戰爭而被破壞，如今總算重新開放參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L15-2-04","sourceFront":"如今","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他不小心摔壞了新買的手機，因此難過得要命。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-14","sourceFront":"摔","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L14-2-02\",\"进\",\"進\",\"进\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B1L16-3-02\",\"中國大陸\",\"中國大陸\",\"中国大陆\",\"N\"]","examples":[],"wordHook":"中國(China) + 大陸(mainland) → Mainland China."},{"key":"[\"B2L07-1-06\",\"訂\",\"訂\",\"订\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"我常上網訂車票、訂旅館，又快又方便。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-06","sourceFront":"訂","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"那家印尼餐廳常常客滿，你最好先打電話訂位。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-1-23","sourceFront":"訂位","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"到東部的火車票很難訂，我訂了好幾次才成功。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-23","sourceFront":"成功","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"參加團體旅遊比較不自由，可是不必自己訂旅館、訂車票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L07-2-13","sourceFront":"自由","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"這家旅館每個房間都設計得很現代，吸引不少年輕人來訂房。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-02","sourceFront":"現代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"花蓮那幾家旅館的雙人客房都客滿了，我們還是訂民宿吧。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L01-1-30","sourceFront":"客房","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣鐵路局的網站訂票，一人最多只能訂六張搭車當天的票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L02-2-28","sourceFront":"最多","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":2,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"過年時，著名點心店都會收到大量的訂單，甚至有顧客在半年前就下訂單了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-16","sourceFront":"訂單","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在臺灣，上網訂好火車票後，可選擇到車站或便利商店取票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-2-21","sourceFront":"取","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我請旅行社代訂從台北直飛美國的班機，機票較貴，但能節省不少時間。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-44","sourceFront":"直飛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽說那場演唱會很熱門，我們最好先預訂門票。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-47","sourceFront":"預訂","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了使客戶安心使用，我們公司產品訂了嚴格的生產標準。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-07","sourceFront":"嚴格","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司的工作須知訂得非常詳細，不過從來沒有員工仔細看完。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-09","sourceFront":"須知","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"旗袍是華人最有特色的服裝之一，我想訂一套屬於我的旗袍。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-05","sourceFront":"旗袍","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"王先生上週向他女友求婚，沒想到才過了幾天就訂婚了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-1-20","sourceFront":"求婚","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L09-2-14\",\"交\",\"交\",\"交\",\"V\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"現在我非常忙，沒有很多時間讀書，可是因為有語言交換，所以我的中文進步了。","pinyin":"Xiànzài wǒ fēicháng máng, méi yǒu hěn duō shíjiān dúshū, kěshì yīnwèi yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, suǒyǐ wǒ de Zhōngwén jìnbù le.","english":"Nowadays, I am very busy; I don’t have much time for studying. However, because of language exchange, I have improved (my Chinese) a lot.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-3-01","sourceFront":"學期","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"可是這些時間我都有語言交換，不能去。","pinyin":"Kěshì zhèxiē shíjiān wǒ dōu yǒu yǔyán jiāohuàn, bù néng qù.","english":"But I will be doing language exchange during that time. I can’t make it.","sourceCardId":"B1L09-2-01","sourceFront":"對面","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 亠(lid) drops onto a 父(father) and locks them together → 交(connect)."},{"key":"[\"B2L13-1-02\",\"产品\",\"產品\",\"产品\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"請你說明一下，這些產品的功能有什麼差別？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L13-1-06","sourceFront":"功能","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"電腦、手機、平板等等，都是3C產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L14-1-22","sourceFront":"等等","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:謝謝你的幫助。沒有你的話， 我一個人很難完成新產品的廣告設計。 B:別這麼說。我們是同事，互相幫助是應該的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-44","sourceFront":"別這麼說","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這裡的每一樣產品都是老闆自己設計的，別的地方找不到相同的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-06","sourceFront":"樣","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"來來來，快來買！我們3C產品的價格最優惠，品質也很好，快把握機會喔！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L03-2-13","sourceFront":"優惠","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":3,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"就要開會了，可是我同事還沒把新產品的說明資料準備好，真叫人緊張。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-2-03","sourceFront":"叫","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這個星期經理一連寫了三個推銷新產品的計畫，每天都忙得不得了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L05-1-35","sourceFront":"一連","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"現代各式各樣的科技產品，讓人們的生活更舒適、便利","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-02","sourceFront":"現代","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"聽到老闆跟經理的對話，我才知道公司新產品的銷售成績不理想。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L11-2-17","sourceFront":"對話","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"A:對這次新產品的銷售方式，你有什麼想法？ B:我在這方面沒什麼經驗，你可以去請教方經理。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L12-1-07","sourceFront":"方面","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"如想通過那家企業的面試，就得先熟悉他們的產品特色與銷售方式。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L14-2-18","sourceFront":"如","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次會議的主題跟銷售新產品有關，所以廣告部門的人員得參加。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L15-1-02","sourceFront":"主題","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":15,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"儘管這次推銷新產品的活動辦得很順利，顧客的反應也很好，不過還是有需要改進的地方。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-06","sourceFront":"改進","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經過服務人員詳細地說明，使得客人對公司的產品更了解了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-13","sourceFront":"使得","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"今天客人跟著小溫去參觀工廠，也試用了新產品，一切安排都令他十分滿意。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L16-2-24","sourceFront":"一切","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"在地理條件好的地區，不但農產品種類較多，價格也便宜。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-06","sourceFront":"農產品","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這次茶會主要是為了招待客戶，同時透過這個茶會來發表公司的新產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-1-12","sourceFront":"茶會","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們國家出口的農產品很有名，不但價格低，品質又好。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L04-2-02","sourceFront":"出口","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"過度消費及使用塑膠材料的產品，都會增加自然環境的負擔。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L05-2-24","sourceFront":"塑膠","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"那項新產品的設計圖你一個人負責太辛苦了，倒不如找同事一起來做。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-2-17","sourceFront":"倒不如","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"經理對新產品計畫的指示不太清楚，我們最好去問清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-01","sourceFront":"指示","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"哎喲，已經半夜一點多了！我們就別再加班寫產品計畫了，等明天再繼續吧！","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L08-1-31","sourceFront":"哎喲","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":8,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了使客戶安心使用，我們公司產品訂了嚴格的生產標準。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-07","sourceFront":"嚴格","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了人民的健康，許多國家都禁止進口受到環境汙染的農產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L10-2-12","sourceFront":"禁止","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"公司不斷推銷新型電子產品，通常是為了刺激客戶購買。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-09","sourceFront":"電子","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"手機廠商時常邀請明星替他們的產品宣傳。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-14","sourceFront":"廠商","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"自動化工廠不僅使生產速度更快，同時也能保證產品品質。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L12-1-46","sourceFront":"自動化","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":12,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們公司在這次電子展共發表了九項新產品，並吸引不少國外客戶來參觀。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-2-13","sourceFront":"共","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"他對發展新科技向來保守，不願接受人工智慧產品。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-1-19","sourceFront":"向來","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"這家工廠奪下了著名品牌產品的製造機會。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L16-2-03","sourceFront":"奪","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L13-2-04\",\"前\",\"前\",\"前\",\"Det\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"前天下午我在學校的圖書館看書。","pinyin":"Qiántiān xiàwǔ wǒ zài xuéxiào de túshūguǎn kànshū.","english":"I read at the school library in the afternoon of the day before yesterday.","sourceCardId":"B1L06-2-20","sourceFront":"前天","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4},{"chinese":"窗戶前面有很多花，很漂亮。","pinyin":"Chuānghù qiánmiàn yǒu hěn duō huā, hěn piàoliàng.","english":"There are many flowers in front of the window. It’s very beautiful.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-3-05","sourceFront":"窗戶","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":3,"rank":4},{"chinese":"我旁邊有日本同學，前面跟後面都有美國同學。","pinyin":"Wǒ pángbiān yǒu Rìběn tóngxué, qiánmiàn gēn hòumiàn dōu yǒu Měiguó tóngxué.","english":"There are Japanese classmates beside me, and there are American classmates in front and behind.","sourceCardId":"B1L05-2-23","sourceFront":"後（面）","sourceBookId":1,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":4}],"wordHook":"a 䒑(grass top) hides a 刖(blade) chopping at the feet in front → 前(the front)."},{"key":"[\"B2L14-1-39\",\"平平安安\",\"平平安安\",\"平平安安\",\"Ph\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"朋友的孩子滿月了，我想送他一份禮，祝福他平平安安地長大。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-21","sourceFront":"禮","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B2L16-1-30\",\"报名\",\"報名\",\"报名\",\"V-sep\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"在德國舉辦的歐洲足球比賽，一共有十二個國家報名。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B2L16-1-30","sourceFront":"報名","sourceBookId":2,"sourceLessonId":16,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"媽媽替我報名了亞洲鋼琴比賽，她說只要我肯努力，一定會有好成績的。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-2-21","sourceFront":"肯","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"報名衝浪課的手續很簡單，只要到辦公室填一張基本資料表就行了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L10-1-28","sourceFront":"表","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":10,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"學校的游泳比賽報名時間到今天截止，有興趣的同學別錯過了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-20","sourceFront":"截止","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"我們工廠與那家旅行社有合作關係，廠內員工如果報名他們的旅行團，都可以享受優惠價。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-14","sourceFront":"旅行社","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5},{"chinese":"你想參加這項長跑比賽的話，可以到網站報名，登記之後會有人跟你聯絡。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L11-2-02","sourceFront":"登記","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":11,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L01-1-38\",\"律师\",\"律師\",\"律师\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"孔先生學法律，不但是為了當好律師，也是為了保護家人。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L01-1-38","sourceFront":"律師","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":1,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"章先生一直想當律師，經過多年的努力，終於夢想成真了。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B3L04-1-23","sourceFront":"終於","sourceBookId":3,"sourceLessonId":4,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B3L03-2-07\",\"摊贩\",\"攤販\",\"摊贩\",\"N\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"何小姐習慣去傳統市場買水果，而且都