餘","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":5,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"為了更有效地利用地球資源，我寧願減少不必要的生活享受。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-2-09","sourceFront":"寧願","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"使用高度技術製造出來的工業生產機器，操作起來往往更有效率。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L13-2-25","sourceFront":"高度","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":13,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":5},{"chinese":"想有效解決身材肥胖的問題，就應避免吃太肥的肉、太油的菜，同時還得多運動。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L14-1-11","sourceFront":"肥胖","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":14,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":5}],"wordHook":"Combining 有(have) and 效(result): 有效 means effective."},{"key":"[\"B4L06-1-43\",\"烂\",\"爛\",\"烂\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"要是你覺得那部電影很爛，我們就走吧，又不是非看不可。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L06-1-43","sourceFront":"爛","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":6,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1}],"wordHook":null},{"key":"[\"B4L09-1-25\",\"严\",\"嚴\",\"严\",\"Vs\"]","examples":[{"chinese":"有些國家機場對攜帶物品的規定很嚴，出國前最好了解清楚。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-25","sourceFront":"嚴","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":1},{"chinese":"部分大學科系對學生成績的要求非常高，畢業條件也較嚴格。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-1-14","sourceFront":"科系","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":2},{"chinese":"為了使客戶安心使用，我們公司產品訂了嚴格的生產標準。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-07","sourceFront":"嚴格","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"亞洲地區發生了嚴重的流行病，使人民受到相當大的生活壓力。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L09-2-16","sourceFront":"受到","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":9,"sourcePartId":2,"rank":3},{"chinese":"開車時萬一發生車禍，千萬要冷靜，以免情況更嚴重。","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L07-1-60","sourceFront":"千萬","sourceBookId":4,"sourceLessonId":7,"sourcePartId":1,"rank":4},{"chinese":"那家工廠的設備及員工都嚴重缺乏，哪裡有辦法進一步發展？","pinyin":"","english":"","sourceCardId":"B4L03-1-39","sourceFront":"哪裡","sourceBookId":4,"